00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
<font color="#FF8040">{\an8}Downloaded From MoviesMod.Org</font>

2
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:48,256
Wow. Tingnan mo nga naman.

3
00:00:48,965 --> 00:00:51,092
-Bakit?
-Mukha ka na talagang cowboy.

4
00:00:51,176 --> 00:00:54,095
Moreno at rugged na ang porma mo.

5
00:00:55,346 --> 00:00:58,475
Eh, ikaw, ang puti mo.
Para kang nagtago buong summer.

6
00:00:58,558 --> 00:01:01,352
Busy ako sa summer school
so di ako nakakapagpaaraw.

7
00:01:02,687 --> 00:01:04,522
-Kumusta sa Montana?
-Ayos lang.

8
00:01:04,606 --> 00:01:08,359
Marami akong natutunan.
Akala ko si Mama ang susundo sa 'kin?

9
00:01:08,943 --> 00:01:09,861
May inaasikaso siya.

10
00:01:11,821 --> 00:01:14,491
Tara na. Sa Wyoming pa 'yong last meal ko.

11
00:02:05,625 --> 00:02:06,584
Miss Howard.

12
00:02:08,253 --> 00:02:11,756
Kumusta ang last day mo
sa pagiging intern? Lawyer ka na ba?

13
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,966
Hindi pa.

14
00:02:14,050 --> 00:02:15,844
Dineliver 'to para sa tito mo.

15
00:02:16,511 --> 00:02:17,762
Nasa Italy pa siya?

16
00:02:19,305 --> 00:02:20,265
Nasa Spain siya.

17
00:02:22,392 --> 00:02:24,853
Miss Howard, may bisita ka nga pala.

18
00:02:28,648 --> 00:02:29,732
Hi, Jackie.

19
00:02:35,196 --> 00:02:37,198
Grabe, nandito pa rin pala 'to?

20
00:02:38,658 --> 00:02:40,994
Madalas kami dito noon ng mama mo.

21
00:02:41,786 --> 00:02:43,163
-Dinala ka na niya dito?
-Oo.

22
00:02:43,246 --> 00:02:45,790
Nagmi-milkshake kami dito
no'ng bata pa 'ko.

23
00:02:47,625 --> 00:02:48,501
Katherine.

24
00:02:50,003 --> 00:02:53,882
Bakit ka pala nandito?
I mean, ayos lang ba kayo

25
00:02:55,508 --> 00:02:56,509
sa Silver Falls?

26
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:59,095
Oo. Okay naman kami.

27
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,892
Ang hindi okay, Jackie,

28
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,394
eto.

29
00:03:10,648 --> 00:03:12,066
Boarding school 'to.

30
00:03:13,943 --> 00:03:15,904
Gusto mo ba talagang pirmahan ko 'to?

31
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:18,573
-'Yan ba ang pinunta mo?
-Siyempre.

32
00:03:19,365 --> 00:03:22,493
Tumawag ako kay Richard,
nasa Barcelona pala siya?

33
00:03:23,703 --> 00:03:25,538
Nagpunta ba siya dito this summer?

34
00:03:26,456 --> 00:03:27,665
Paminsan-minsan.

35
00:03:27,749 --> 00:03:31,711
Pero one month dito si Danny,
nandito din 'yong housekeeper

36
00:03:31,794 --> 00:03:34,923
at si Al, 'yong doorman.
Okay naman ako dito.

37
00:03:35,006 --> 00:03:39,177
Kung gusto mo dito sa city,
mauunawaan ko pa, pero kung Vermont?

38
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:40,345
Magandang school 'yon.

39
00:03:40,428 --> 00:03:45,058
Ewan ko ba pero feeling ko
makakabuti kung nasa ibang lugar ako.

40
00:03:45,141 --> 00:03:47,560
Akala ko ba okay dito? Mukhang masaya ka.

41
00:03:47,644 --> 00:03:49,103
Oo pero noon 'yon.

42
00:03:49,604 --> 00:03:51,981
May problema ba?

43
00:03:52,815 --> 00:03:56,194
Tungkol ba 'to kay Alex o sa ibang tao?

44
00:03:56,277 --> 00:03:59,030
Hindi. Kinailangan ko lang

45
00:04:00,281 --> 00:04:01,282
umalis.

46
00:04:01,783 --> 00:04:05,912
Gusto ko lang umalis sa Silver Falls
at bumalik dito sa New York,

47
00:04:05,995 --> 00:04:08,831
gaya ng dati bago ang lahat.

48
00:04:08,915 --> 00:04:10,750
Pero pakiramdam ko, dayo ako dito.

49
00:04:16,673 --> 00:04:17,590
So…

50
00:04:18,299 --> 00:04:21,261
So nakipagkita ako
sa dati kong friends pagbalik ko dito.

51
00:04:21,928 --> 00:04:25,056
Pero ang dami nang nagbago.

52
00:04:25,723 --> 00:04:27,934
Di na gaya ng dati 'yong buhay namin.

53
00:04:28,977 --> 00:04:34,107
Nagpunta rin ako sa mga lugar
na pinupuntahan namin noon nina Lucy,

54
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:39,487
Mama, at Papa,
gaya ng The Cloisters at Lincoln Center,

55
00:04:39,570 --> 00:04:43,032
pero ibang-iba na, ngayong wala na sila.

56
00:04:46,619 --> 00:04:48,037
Kaya na-realize kong

57
00:04:49,455 --> 00:04:51,040
di na ako belong dito.

58
00:04:53,334 --> 00:04:54,877
Di ako belong kahit saan.

59
00:04:55,503 --> 00:04:59,590
So naghahanap ako ng bagong lugar
para makapagsimula ulit.

60
00:05:03,594 --> 00:05:07,056
Nagpupunta kami dito ng mama mo
pag may pinagdadaanan kami,

61
00:05:07,932 --> 00:05:11,227
gaya ng breakup o bagsak na test.

62
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:14,397
Pero madalas ako 'yon
kasi di siya bumabagsak.

63
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:19,193
Naisip namin na kaya naming
solusyunan ang lahat

64
00:05:19,277 --> 00:05:21,988
sa tulong ng buttter,
chocolate, at pag-uusap.

65
00:05:22,989 --> 00:05:26,367
-Mabuti nandyan ka para sa kanya.
-Well, ako 'yong madalas magsalita.

66
00:05:27,493 --> 00:05:29,370
Good listener 'yong mama mo.

67
00:05:32,165 --> 00:05:35,793
Pinili at tinuring naming pamilya
ni Angelica 'yong isa't isa.

68
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:40,465
Lahat kami, Jackie.

69
00:05:40,965 --> 00:05:43,843
Ako, si George, at ang kids,
family ang turing namin sa 'yo.

70
00:05:44,427 --> 00:05:45,970
Kahit ano, maaayos natin.

71
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:49,807
Gusto naming sa 'min ka tumira.

72
00:05:52,518 --> 00:05:54,437
Di ko alam kung kaya ko.

73
00:05:58,316 --> 00:06:02,111
Okay, well, nandito lang ako
kahit ano'ng mangyari.

74
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:04,155
Kung gusto mo sa Vermont,
bibisitahin kita.

75
00:06:04,238 --> 00:06:06,574
Ang ganda kaya sa Green Mountain State.

76
00:06:11,537 --> 00:06:13,039
Belong ka, Jackie.

77
00:06:15,291 --> 00:06:16,417
Sa 'min.

78
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,882
Effective 'yong pang-trick sa kalaban.

79
00:07:19,897 --> 00:07:21,357
Magiging okay din ang lahat.

80
00:07:22,733 --> 00:07:24,235
Kung hindi, magsabi ka, okay?

81
00:07:25,319 --> 00:07:26,279
Okay.

82
00:07:26,779 --> 00:07:29,407
Nabanggit niya ba sa 'yong
babalik siya dito?

83
00:07:29,490 --> 00:07:33,953
Sa New York pa kami huling nagkausap,
pero okay na ring nandito siya, di ba?

84
00:07:45,923 --> 00:07:47,675
Danny, patulong naman ako.

85
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,267
-Game.
-Jackie!

86
00:07:56,767 --> 00:08:00,229
-Ipapakilala ko sa 'yo si Gregory Peck.
-Okay… Sino? Ano?

87
00:08:00,313 --> 00:08:01,647
'Yong manok niya 'yon.

88
00:08:02,148 --> 00:08:05,067
-Pinalaki ko siya simula baby siya.
-Sisiw, Benny.

89
00:08:05,151 --> 00:08:06,903
-Babae si Gregory.
-Mahalaga ba 'yon?

90
00:08:06,986 --> 00:08:08,571
Oo kung gusto mo ng itlog.

91
00:08:08,654 --> 00:08:10,948
Okay, tara na, guys. Game na.

92
00:08:13,117 --> 00:08:14,660
Red, 60!

93
00:08:14,744 --> 00:08:16,954
-Isaac, dito!
-Go!

94
00:08:17,038 --> 00:08:17,872
Game na!

95
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:21,542
Jordan!

96
00:08:22,668 --> 00:08:23,669
Let's go!

97
00:08:23,753 --> 00:08:25,546
-Let's go, Jordan!
-Salamat.

98
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,048
Takbo!

99
00:08:29,383 --> 00:08:31,177
-Jordan!
-Dito!

100
00:08:38,184 --> 00:08:39,018
Jordan!

101
00:08:40,478 --> 00:08:41,354
Ang galing.

102
00:08:41,437 --> 00:08:42,271
-Good job.
-Hi.

103
00:08:43,105 --> 00:08:43,981
Hi.

104
00:08:44,065 --> 00:08:45,274
Uy, Jackie!

105
00:08:46,609 --> 00:08:47,443
Welcome back.

106
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:49,362
-Na-miss kita.
-Ako din.

107
00:08:49,445 --> 00:08:50,488
Salamat, George.

108
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:53,658
Hi, Parker.

109
00:08:54,992 --> 00:08:56,661
Hi, Jackie. Welcome home.

110
00:08:57,161 --> 00:08:58,120
Good to see you.

111
00:09:00,081 --> 00:09:00,915
Oo.

112
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:03,042
Ikaw din.

113
00:09:04,377 --> 00:09:05,545
Ituloy natin 'yon mamaya.

114
00:09:07,463 --> 00:09:12,009
-Okay, ia-unpack ko na muna 'to.
-Kung may kailangan ka, magsabi ka lang.

115
00:09:13,803 --> 00:09:15,263
So kumusta?

116
00:09:15,346 --> 00:09:17,056
Well, nandito na siya.

117
00:09:17,807 --> 00:09:19,100
Ba't daw siya umalis?

118
00:09:19,183 --> 00:09:23,521
Di niya sinabi, pero alam nating
may kinalaman 'yon kay Alex at Cole.

119
00:09:24,063 --> 00:09:25,773
Sana magkaayos na sila.

120
00:09:25,856 --> 00:09:28,109
Siguro dapat kausapin ko siya lagi.

121
00:09:28,859 --> 00:09:30,194
Sisiguruhin nating okay siya.

122
00:09:30,278 --> 00:09:33,864
-Sisiguruhin nating okay silang lahat.
-Gusto mo ba ng tsaa.

123
00:09:33,948 --> 00:09:35,199
Oo, please.

124
00:09:38,536 --> 00:09:43,124
Ipapadala ko sana 'yan sa 'yo pero
naisip kong ibigay na lang pagbalik mo.

125
00:09:44,333 --> 00:09:45,334
Thanks, Nathan.

126
00:09:48,921 --> 00:09:50,131
Na-miss ka namin.

127
00:09:50,631 --> 00:09:51,882
Na-miss ka din ni Skylar.

128
00:09:53,426 --> 00:09:56,721
-Kumusta siya?
-Well… Gano'n pa rin.

129
00:09:58,431 --> 00:09:59,265
Eh, si Grace?

130
00:09:59,348 --> 00:10:01,684
Di kami nagkikita no'ng summer.

131
00:10:02,351 --> 00:10:05,271
Sana naman bumuli ka
ng mini pastries sa Zabar's.

132
00:10:05,354 --> 00:10:08,941
-'Yon ang pinakamasarap kong…
-'Yon ang pinakamasarap mong natikman?

133
00:10:09,025 --> 00:10:10,359
Oo, alam ko na 'yon.

134
00:10:10,443 --> 00:10:12,612
Bukam-bibig niya 'yon
mula no'ng umuwi siya.

135
00:10:12,695 --> 00:10:15,114
-Di, 'no.
-Saka 'yong movies sa IFC.

136
00:10:15,197 --> 00:10:18,659
Saka 'yong eggs Benedict dish
sa isang restaurant sa 4th Street,

137
00:10:18,743 --> 00:10:21,245
'yong Jane's Carousel,
at Roosevelt Island Tramway…

138
00:10:21,329 --> 00:10:24,123
-Astig naman talaga 'yon.
-Di ko 'yon nakalimutan.

139
00:10:24,206 --> 00:10:25,750
Salamat. Nakakatuwa naman.

140
00:10:26,542 --> 00:10:28,919
-Pwedeng patikim?
-Ayoko. Akin 'to.

141
00:10:29,003 --> 00:10:31,255
Wow. Well, masaya akong
nandito ka na ulit.

142
00:10:31,339 --> 00:10:33,507
May makakausap na siya
tungkol sa New York.

143
00:10:34,008 --> 00:10:34,842
Hoy!

144
00:10:37,678 --> 00:10:38,638
So, miss mo na do'n?

145
00:10:38,721 --> 00:10:39,847
Oo.

146
00:10:39,930 --> 00:10:43,601
Miss ko na
pero natutuwa ako na nakauwi na 'ko.

147
00:10:44,226 --> 00:10:46,020
Nalungkot ba si Richard pag-alis mo?

148
00:10:47,313 --> 00:10:49,398
Siguro. Pero busy siya,

149
00:10:50,024 --> 00:10:53,569
malamang masaya siya
na dito ako pumunta imbes na sa Vermont.

150
00:10:54,236 --> 00:10:55,154
Eh, ikaw ba?

151
00:10:55,237 --> 00:10:57,323
Masaya ka bang dito ka pumunta?

152
00:10:58,699 --> 00:11:01,577
Ang weird lang
na kahit familiar 'tong lugar,

153
00:11:02,244 --> 00:11:04,664
pakiramdam ko pa rin dayo ako dito.

154
00:11:05,456 --> 00:11:06,707
Sa ngayon.

155
00:11:07,375 --> 00:11:09,001
Alam mo, nalungkot kaming lahat

156
00:11:09,585 --> 00:11:10,753
no'ng umalis ka.

157
00:11:10,836 --> 00:11:13,005
Pero masaya na ang lahat
kasi bumalik ka na.

158
00:11:13,089 --> 00:11:14,256
Lahat?

159
00:11:15,966 --> 00:11:19,261
Well, di magtatagal
matutuwa rin 'yong iba.

160
00:11:20,346 --> 00:11:21,681
Wag ka nang mag-alala.

161
00:11:36,612 --> 00:11:37,613
Okay ka lang, P?

162
00:11:40,866 --> 00:11:42,576
Ni hindi siya nagpaalam noon.

163
00:11:47,707 --> 00:11:49,166
May dahilan siya.

164
00:11:57,842 --> 00:11:59,677
Ayos lang kung na-miss mo siya.

165
00:12:12,106 --> 00:12:16,068
-Wag mo naman akong talunin.
-Naiinis ka lang kasi mas magaling ako.

166
00:12:46,599 --> 00:12:47,433
Hi.

167
00:12:48,517 --> 00:12:49,435
Uy.

168
00:12:53,939 --> 00:12:54,774
So,

169
00:12:56,692 --> 00:12:58,569
kumusta sa Montana?

170
00:12:59,153 --> 00:13:02,198
Kagaya lang din dito.
Mag mga kabayo at bundok.

171
00:13:06,577 --> 00:13:08,412
Alex, may…

172
00:13:09,038 --> 00:13:10,247
May pasalubong ako.

173
00:13:11,207 --> 00:13:16,712
Ang sabi sa 'kin sa bookstore,
magugustuhan 'to ng sci-fi fantasy fan.

174
00:13:18,088 --> 00:13:19,006
New series 'to.

175
00:13:21,383 --> 00:13:25,387
Salamat. Di na ako interesado sa fantasy.

176
00:13:28,641 --> 00:13:30,810
Alex, 'yong pag-alis ko,

177
00:13:30,893 --> 00:13:34,230
-gusto ko sanang magpaliwanag.
-Okay lang. Alam ko.

178
00:13:34,313 --> 00:13:37,942
Wala ako sa ayos no'n.
Di ko dapat sinabi 'yong mga nasabi ko.

179
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:40,486
-Di 'yon dahil do'n…
-Di na mahalaga 'yon.

180
00:13:40,569 --> 00:13:43,447
-Umalis ka, tapos bumalik ka na.
-Oo, pero…

181
00:13:43,531 --> 00:13:46,325
Aasikasuhin ko muna si Murphy.
May pasok pa 'ko.

182
00:13:48,202 --> 00:13:49,036
Okay.

183
00:13:58,212 --> 00:13:59,338
Alex…

184
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,802
Okay ba tayong dalawa?

185
00:14:06,095 --> 00:14:07,763
Oo. Okay naman.

186
00:14:21,777 --> 00:14:23,320
-Morning, Jackie.
-Morning.

187
00:14:23,404 --> 00:14:24,238
Hi.

188
00:14:24,321 --> 00:14:26,448
May toast dyan.

189
00:14:26,532 --> 00:14:27,867
-Salamat.
-At saka…

190
00:14:27,950 --> 00:14:31,203
Nilipat sa community center park
'yong football practice ni Parker?

191
00:14:31,287 --> 00:14:35,666
Oo, kasabay 'yon ng swim class ni Benny,
na sa kabilang part naman ng bayan.

192
00:14:36,542 --> 00:14:37,626
Ako na dyan.

193
00:14:37,710 --> 00:14:41,005
-Hindi. Kaya ko na 'to.
-Katherine, patulungin mo na 'ko.

194
00:14:41,088 --> 00:14:42,715
-Okay. Salamat.
-Please.

195
00:14:43,424 --> 00:14:44,592
Uy, honey.

196
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:48,304
Today 'yong Ag Soc meeting ko sa Lockwood.

197
00:14:48,387 --> 00:14:52,057
Okay, ihahatid ko na lang
si Parker sa football

198
00:14:52,141 --> 00:14:56,270
after kong ihatid sa film club si Jordan,
at saka ko susunduin si Benny.

199
00:14:56,353 --> 00:14:58,814
Tapos na ang practice ni Benny no'n.
Mahirap 'yon.

200
00:14:58,898 --> 00:15:01,108
-Magba-bike na lang ako.
-Hindi!

201
00:15:01,191 --> 00:15:03,986
Ba't nilapat ang football?
Nadiskartehan natin 'to last year.

202
00:15:04,069 --> 00:15:04,904
Ewan ko ba.

203
00:15:04,987 --> 00:15:07,656
Di ko alam
kung magagawan ko 'to ng paraan.

204
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:09,909
Pero magpipilian na ng players this week.

205
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:13,287
-Sino'ng gusto ng itlog?
-Gagawa ako ng paraan.

206
00:15:13,370 --> 00:15:15,247
-Ako!
-Ako, wag masyadong malasado.

207
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,084
Excuse me.

208
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,212
Uy, Cole, Danny,

209
00:15:22,296 --> 00:15:24,924
pakihatid si Parker
sa football practice niya.

210
00:15:25,007 --> 00:15:26,800
Di pwede. May group study ako.

211
00:15:30,387 --> 00:15:31,472
Bakit?

212
00:15:34,683 --> 00:15:35,517
Ikaw, Danny?

213
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:38,020
Pwede pero di ako
makakapag-sign up sa drama club,

214
00:15:38,103 --> 00:15:42,399
-at today ia-assign ang scene partners.
-Kulang na kulang tayo sa drivers.

215
00:15:42,483 --> 00:15:45,194
-Gagawan natin 'to ng paraan.
-Okay.

216
00:15:45,778 --> 00:15:48,781
Alam ko na.
Si Will, baka pwede ka niyang maihatid.

217
00:15:48,864 --> 00:15:50,366
Guys, eto ang lunch n'yo.

218
00:15:50,449 --> 00:15:52,618
Sino ba dapat ang kukuha ng itlog?

219
00:15:52,701 --> 00:15:54,411
-Nanguha ako no'ng Friday.
-Di ako.

220
00:15:54,495 --> 00:15:56,413
-Si Jordan dapat.
-Manahimik ka.

221
00:15:58,082 --> 00:16:01,377
Kung gusto n'yong mag-almusal,
kumuha kayo ng itlog.

222
00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:02,836
Aalis na 'ko. Bye.

223
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:03,837
Ako na.

224
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:12,596
Kailangan mo ng tulong?

225
00:16:14,723 --> 00:16:16,308
Hindi. Kaya ko na 'to.

226
00:16:17,518 --> 00:16:18,352
Salamat.

227
00:16:24,942 --> 00:16:27,444
Jackie, pwede bang tumigil ka muna?

228
00:16:33,033 --> 00:16:35,035
Ibibigay ko pa 'to kay Danny.

229
00:16:47,715 --> 00:16:48,549
Nahanap ko na.

230
00:16:49,049 --> 00:16:50,592
-Hay, salamat.
-Okay.

231
00:16:50,676 --> 00:16:53,095
Pakidiligan 'tong si Friedrich, okay?

232
00:16:53,595 --> 00:16:54,596
Friedrich?

233
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:56,432
-Etong ficus ko.
-Okay.

234
00:16:56,515 --> 00:16:59,476
Pero katamtaman lang
para di siya malunod sa tubig.

235
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:00,394
Sige.

236
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:02,104
Okay.

237
00:17:03,856 --> 00:17:07,609
Phone, wallet, passport, boarding pass.

238
00:17:12,448 --> 00:17:13,615
Ano'ng problema?

239
00:17:14,324 --> 00:17:15,451
-Di ako tutuloy.
-Bakit?

240
00:17:15,534 --> 00:17:16,368
Ayoko na.

241
00:17:16,452 --> 00:17:17,703
Gusto mo, ano ka ba?

242
00:17:18,370 --> 00:17:20,247
Isang buong semester ka sa Chile, oh.

243
00:17:20,956 --> 00:17:24,084
Three months ka sa agricultural work.
Pangarap mo 'to.

244
00:17:28,047 --> 00:17:29,131
Sumama ka sa 'kin.

245
00:17:31,133 --> 00:17:34,178
Hayles, napag-usapan na natin 'to.

246
00:17:35,179 --> 00:17:40,601
Ano'ng gagawin ko sa biodynamic farm
somewhere sa Chile

247
00:17:40,684 --> 00:17:43,437
-habang ginagawa mo 'yong thesis mo?
-Sabagay.

248
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:46,231
Saka magiging busy ako
sa ranch development.

249
00:17:46,315 --> 00:17:47,149
Alam ko.

250
00:17:47,775 --> 00:17:49,026
Alam ko. Tama ka.

251
00:17:51,028 --> 00:17:52,237
Mami-miss kita.

252
00:17:53,572 --> 00:17:54,406
Ako din.

253
00:17:57,117 --> 00:17:59,661
-Di naman 'yon aabutin ng three months…
-Oo.

254
00:17:59,745 --> 00:18:01,413
-Mabilis lang 'yon.
-Oo.

255
00:18:01,497 --> 00:18:05,167
Maliban kung may makilala akong
Chilean na machong magsasaka.

256
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:08,337
-Wag naman.
-Di ako sure. Ayokong mangako.

257
00:18:08,837 --> 00:18:11,006
Okay. Lumakad na tayo. Tara.

258
00:18:11,090 --> 00:18:11,965
Okay. Sandali.

259
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:16,553
May 20 minutes pa tayo.

260
00:18:30,234 --> 00:18:31,693
Oh my God, Jackie!

261
00:18:31,777 --> 00:18:34,822
-Hi! Grabe, na-miss kita!
-Hi, Grace.

262
00:18:34,905 --> 00:18:39,201
Ang boring buong summer. Muntik na
'kong sumali sa prayer group nila Mama.

263
00:18:39,284 --> 00:18:41,370
Di ba kayo nagkita ni Skylar?

264
00:18:41,453 --> 00:18:44,540
Hindi, eh. In love sila ni Nathan
so nagso-solo sila.

265
00:18:44,623 --> 00:18:49,628
So tumulong na lang ako sa church
tapos nag-babysit ako.

266
00:18:49,711 --> 00:18:52,131
Sorry di tayo nagkausap nitong summer.

267
00:18:52,214 --> 00:18:53,507
Ayos lang.

268
00:18:53,590 --> 00:18:56,051
Bumawi ka na lang,
ichika mo sa 'kin ang lahat.

269
00:18:56,135 --> 00:19:00,013
Kumusta? Nagde-date pa ba kayo ni Alex?
Usap-usapan 'yon dito.

270
00:19:00,097 --> 00:19:03,267
-Complicated, eh.
-Pa'nong complicated?

271
00:19:06,854 --> 00:19:08,021
Sandali.

272
00:19:10,774 --> 00:19:11,608
Ano ba?

273
00:19:11,692 --> 00:19:14,236
Sinabi niyang mahal niya 'ko no'ng kasal.

274
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:17,489
Jackie! Oh my God! Ano'ng sinabi mo?

275
00:19:17,573 --> 00:19:21,368
-Wala. Nakainom na siya no'n…
-So di mo sinabing mahal mo siya?

276
00:19:21,451 --> 00:19:25,831
Di ko alam ang dapat kong sabihin no'n.
Sweet si Alex,

277
00:19:25,914 --> 00:19:28,083
at masaya ako pag kasama ko siya.

278
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:31,336
-Pero si Cole…
-Ano'ng meron kay Cole?

279
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:34,131
Nalaman kong inayos niya
'yong teapot ni Lucy,

280
00:19:34,214 --> 00:19:36,800
na plano niyang ibigay sa 'kin
no'ng Thanksgiving. Tapos…

281
00:19:36,884 --> 00:19:39,386
Tapos? Nagtsaa ka? Ichika mo na!

282
00:19:41,138 --> 00:19:43,140
Nag-kiss kami.

283
00:19:43,223 --> 00:19:45,058
Nag-kiss kayo ni Cole Walter?

284
00:19:45,893 --> 00:19:49,646
Jackie, oh my God.
Pero nagde-date kayo ni Alex no'n, di ba?

285
00:19:50,814 --> 00:19:51,940
Alam niya ba 'to?

286
00:19:54,818 --> 00:19:56,111
Grabe, Jackie…

287
00:19:56,195 --> 00:19:59,364
Alam ko. Nagkamali ako.

288
00:20:00,866 --> 00:20:02,534
So nagde-date na ba kayo ni Cole?

289
00:20:02,618 --> 00:20:04,369
Hindi. Ano ka ba? Hindi.

290
00:20:04,453 --> 00:20:05,662
Gusto mo ba?

291
00:20:05,746 --> 00:20:06,997
Grace, hindi.

292
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:09,666
Saka di na mahalaga kung ano'ng gusto ko.

293
00:20:09,750 --> 00:20:12,211
Ang mahalaga dapat itama ko 'to.

294
00:20:12,294 --> 00:20:14,796
Ano'ng ibig mong sabihin? Ano'ng plano mo?

295
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:17,633
Una, magda-driving lessons ako.
Kailangan ko ng license.

296
00:20:17,716 --> 00:20:20,761
-Di ba di nagda-drive ang New Yorkers?
-Di na 'ko New Yorker.

297
00:20:21,303 --> 00:20:23,513
Aayusin ko 'yong sa 'min ni Alex.

298
00:20:25,474 --> 00:20:26,892
Masyadong malungkot.

299
00:20:35,192 --> 00:20:36,568
Magiging okay din kayo.

300
00:20:37,611 --> 00:20:38,445
Oo naman.

301
00:20:43,992 --> 00:20:46,787
Kaninang umaga ka pa may ka-chat.
Sino ba 'yan?

302
00:20:47,829 --> 00:20:49,456
-Si Danny.
-Danny Walter?

303
00:20:49,539 --> 00:20:51,583
Magka-text na kami mula summer.

304
00:20:52,334 --> 00:20:55,295
Ano'ng reaction
ng twin brother niya diyan?

305
00:20:55,379 --> 00:20:59,841
Wala na akong pakialam
sa iisipin ni Cole Walter.

306
00:21:03,679 --> 00:21:04,596
Pasok.

307
00:21:05,973 --> 00:21:06,974
Jackie!

308
00:21:07,683 --> 00:21:09,476
Nakakatuwang bumalik ka na. Tuloy ka.

309
00:21:09,559 --> 00:21:11,019
-Salamat.
-Upo ka.

310
00:21:11,728 --> 00:21:13,563
Di ka pala tumuloy sa boarding school?

311
00:21:14,314 --> 00:21:16,358
Ni-request no'ng school
'yong transcripts mo.

312
00:21:16,441 --> 00:21:17,734
Oo nga pala.

313
00:21:18,527 --> 00:21:21,488
Masaya ako na mas pinili mong bumalik.

314
00:21:21,571 --> 00:21:23,282
Masuwerte sa 'yo ang Silver Falls.

315
00:21:23,991 --> 00:21:24,825
Salamat.

316
00:21:26,118 --> 00:21:30,580
-Bale late na 'ko sa pagpili ng electives.
-Okay. I-check natin.

317
00:21:33,375 --> 00:21:37,004
-Oo. Wala ka pa ni isa.
-Gusto ko sanang mag-driving lessons.

318
00:21:37,087 --> 00:21:39,256
Naku, sorry, Jackie. Puna na, eh.

319
00:21:39,339 --> 00:21:41,258
Maraming nagda-driving lessons.

320
00:21:42,634 --> 00:21:45,887
Woodshop na lang ang open na elective.

321
00:21:46,805 --> 00:21:47,806
Ano?

322
00:21:48,307 --> 00:21:51,935
Isipin mo na lang,
maraming nangangailangan ng shelves.

323
00:21:54,479 --> 00:21:58,191
Dito ang guest parking area,
at maglalakad sila papuntang yurts.

324
00:21:58,734 --> 00:21:59,818
Dapat iurong ang yurts…

325
00:21:59,901 --> 00:22:02,779
Kailanganin natin ng maraming kabayo
at malaking kuwadra soon.

326
00:22:02,863 --> 00:22:05,532
O kaya rumenta muna tayo
ng kabayo kung kukulangin.

327
00:22:05,615 --> 00:22:09,202
Gagawin 'tong venue para sa gatherings.
Kumuha tayo ng liquor license.

328
00:22:09,286 --> 00:22:11,788
Dito naman magsisimula ang dark sky tours.

329
00:22:12,873 --> 00:22:13,707
Okay.

330
00:22:15,625 --> 00:22:18,628
Well, ayos 'to.
Mukhang pinagplanuhan mo talaga 'to,

331
00:22:18,712 --> 00:22:22,424
pero pakilipat ang yurts sa back field.
Ayokong nandito 'yon.

332
00:22:22,507 --> 00:22:25,677
Di ako sure sa dark sky tours.
Sino'ng papatos do'n?

333
00:22:25,761 --> 00:22:27,637
Di tayo maalam sa astronomy.

334
00:22:27,721 --> 00:22:31,058
Kukuha tayo ng tao para do'n.
Pag-usapan din natin 'yan.

335
00:22:31,641 --> 00:22:35,020
Staff. Two full-time staff
ang nasa budget, pero apat ang kailangan.

336
00:22:35,103 --> 00:22:35,937
Apat?

337
00:22:36,730 --> 00:22:39,566
Akala ko ba pagkakakitaan 'to,
hindi pagkakagastusan?

338
00:22:48,575 --> 00:22:53,038
Alam n'yo ba kung ano ang lathe?

339
00:22:54,831 --> 00:22:55,665
Hindi?

340
00:22:56,666 --> 00:22:58,126
Sige.

341
00:22:58,627 --> 00:23:00,712
Pang-ikot ng kahoy ang lathe.

342
00:23:01,296 --> 00:23:04,716
Para makagawa ng mangkok, spindles,
at paa ng furnitures.

343
00:23:04,800 --> 00:23:08,095
Ginagamit 'yon pambilog ng kahoy.

344
00:23:13,683 --> 00:23:14,684
Kumusta?

345
00:23:14,768 --> 00:23:15,769
Well,

346
00:23:16,645 --> 00:23:20,732
as of next semester,
wala na 'kong trabaho.

347
00:23:23,276 --> 00:23:28,115
Nakabalik na mula sa leave si Ms. Elson,
saka technically nagpaalam na 'ko.

348
00:23:28,198 --> 00:23:30,867
Pero may trabaho ka ngayon, di ba?

349
00:23:30,951 --> 00:23:34,496
Part-time. Nagtuturo ako
ng Drama at English Lit sa freshman.

350
00:23:34,579 --> 00:23:37,541
-Mina-manage ko rin ang newspaper club.
-Ayun naman pala.

351
00:23:38,041 --> 00:23:41,461
Saka malay mo may dumating
na oppotunity para sa 'yo.

352
00:23:42,087 --> 00:23:42,963
Alam mo,

353
00:23:43,630 --> 00:23:47,342
no'ng tinanggihan ko 'yong work sa London,
di ko akalaing magiging unemployed ako.

354
00:23:47,426 --> 00:23:48,260
Uy.

355
00:23:49,136 --> 00:23:50,637
Di ka unemployed, 'no.

356
00:23:51,930 --> 00:23:53,598
May ibang opportunity na darating.

357
00:23:54,182 --> 00:23:55,016
Alam mo,

358
00:23:56,893 --> 00:23:59,563
di mo kailangang magpaka-positive palagi.

359
00:24:00,647 --> 00:24:01,481
Pero

360
00:24:02,566 --> 00:24:06,027
naniniwala ako sa 'yo.
Alam kong magsa-succeed ka.

361
00:24:07,237 --> 00:24:08,071
Okay.

362
00:24:08,989 --> 00:24:11,950
Ire-ready ko na muna
'yong newspaper room, okay?

363
00:24:17,330 --> 00:24:20,375
Eto ang Driver's Lesson.
Ako si Coach Allen.

364
00:24:20,459 --> 00:24:21,960
Maupo ka na.

365
00:24:22,043 --> 00:24:23,211
Uy, Alex.

366
00:24:23,795 --> 00:24:25,172
Pwedeng ba 'kong umupo dito?

367
00:24:25,755 --> 00:24:27,048
Oo naman.

368
00:24:28,175 --> 00:24:29,176
Ayos.

369
00:24:35,849 --> 00:24:37,601
Hindi madali ang pagmamaneho.

370
00:24:37,684 --> 00:24:39,811
-Ayos 'yon.
-Kailangan n'yong mag-focus.

371
00:24:40,437 --> 00:24:42,397
Makinig kayong mabuti.
Day one pa lang 'to.

372
00:24:42,898 --> 00:24:45,692
BAWAS NA PONDO, BIGONG PANGAKO:
SULIRANIN NG SILVER FALLS HIGH

373
00:24:46,359 --> 00:24:47,277
Hi.

374
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:48,320
Hi.

375
00:24:48,904 --> 00:24:50,071
-Hi, Olivia.
-Hi.

376
00:24:51,448 --> 00:24:54,493
Gusto kong sumali sa newspaper club.

377
00:24:54,576 --> 00:24:56,703
Ano? Bakit?

378
00:24:56,786 --> 00:24:59,915
Sabi ng class adviser ko,
kailangan namin ng extracurriculars,

379
00:24:59,998 --> 00:25:04,044
-eh 'yong banda lang ang meron ako.
-Ba't newspaper ang napili mo?

380
00:25:04,127 --> 00:25:06,421
Mahilig akong magsulat
at gusto kong mag-improve.

381
00:25:06,505 --> 00:25:09,424
Saka di nila ako pinasali last year
kasi freshman pa 'ko no'n.

382
00:25:09,508 --> 00:25:12,594
Baka may chance na 'ko
dahil ikaw ang new editor.

383
00:25:14,304 --> 00:25:16,806
Dapat maganda ang paper this year.

384
00:25:16,890 --> 00:25:20,268
Gusto ko seryoso at malalim
na usapin ang laman nito,

385
00:25:20,352 --> 00:25:23,855
imbes na puro football games
at student council lang.

386
00:25:25,482 --> 00:25:28,693
-Gusto mong basahin 'yong first edition?
-Ngayon? Sige.

387
00:25:29,736 --> 00:25:32,239
Malaki ang binawas sa pondo ng school.

388
00:25:32,739 --> 00:25:35,867
Art ang unang pinakaapektado
pag kulang ang pondo.

389
00:25:35,951 --> 00:25:39,329
Maaapektuhan ang banda, drama,
at after-school activities.

390
00:25:40,330 --> 00:25:43,083
Pero ang football team,
malamang di apektado.

391
00:25:44,459 --> 00:25:46,836
Di naman siguro nila ika-cancel
'yong fall formal?

392
00:25:47,629 --> 00:25:48,547
Sana nga hindi.

393
00:25:48,630 --> 00:25:50,465
Pero di biro 'tong pagbabawas ng pondo.

394
00:25:50,549 --> 00:25:54,219
Ginawan ko 'to ng special editorial.
Pandagdag sa portfolio ko sa Georgetown.

395
00:25:54,302 --> 00:25:57,514
Baka matulungan kita
bilang unofficial assistant editor?

396
00:25:59,516 --> 00:26:02,561
Marami kang pagdadaanan
bago maging assistant editor.

397
00:26:04,521 --> 00:26:08,483
Saka pag sumali ka dito,
boss mo 'ko dito, hindi boyfriend.

398
00:26:09,109 --> 00:26:10,318
Okay, boss.

399
00:26:11,778 --> 00:26:13,238
So kasali na 'ko?

400
00:26:16,283 --> 00:26:18,702
Oo. Kasali ka na.

401
00:26:21,121 --> 00:26:23,540
-Excited na excited ka, ah.
-Sinabi mo pa.

402
00:26:24,249 --> 00:26:26,585
Sabihin mo kung ano ang pinagkaiba…

403
00:26:26,668 --> 00:26:30,755
First day pa lang. Dapat turuan niya
muna tayo. 'Yon ang role niya.

404
00:26:33,508 --> 00:26:34,593
Okay ka lang ba?

405
00:26:35,218 --> 00:26:37,679
Oo. Di ko lang alam
na close pala sila ni Ruby.

406
00:26:42,058 --> 00:26:44,936
-Akala ko kukunin mo 'yong books mo?
-Mamaya na lang.

407
00:26:55,905 --> 00:26:57,324
Hindi, malabo 'yon…

408
00:27:12,922 --> 00:27:13,965
Guys,

409
00:27:14,549 --> 00:27:18,178
gusto ko lang sabihing
masaya ako na magkakasama na ulit tayo.

410
00:27:19,095 --> 00:27:22,015
Alex at Danny,
nami-miss namin kayo buong summer.

411
00:27:22,098 --> 00:27:24,684
Ako, hindi. Na-enjoy ko 'yong katahimikan.

412
00:27:27,312 --> 00:27:30,815
Jackie… Natutuwa kami na umuwi ka na.

413
00:27:30,899 --> 00:27:32,150
Oo, na-miss kita, Jackie.

414
00:27:32,233 --> 00:27:34,152
Cheers, nandito na ulit si Jackie!

415
00:27:34,235 --> 00:27:35,320
-To Jackie!
-To Jackie!

416
00:27:35,403 --> 00:27:36,363
To Jackie.

417
00:27:36,863 --> 00:27:39,199
Mas masaya dito
kesa sa boarding school, di ba?

418
00:27:39,741 --> 00:27:40,950
-Anong sabi niya?
-Ano daw?

419
00:27:41,034 --> 00:27:43,286
Magbo-boarding school dapat si Jackie.

420
00:27:46,414 --> 00:27:48,041
Excuse lang muna.

421
00:27:50,585 --> 00:27:53,088
-Sige. Bumalik ka pag nandito na ang food.
-Salamat.

422
00:28:03,139 --> 00:28:04,140
Hi.

423
00:28:05,767 --> 00:28:06,601
Cole,

424
00:28:07,435 --> 00:28:09,771
good job sa payo mo kay Isaac sa game.

425
00:28:10,522 --> 00:28:11,981
-Di ako 'yon.
-Ikaw talaga.

426
00:28:12,065 --> 00:28:15,652
Kabisado ko ang galawang Cole Walter.
Kung interesado ka,

427
00:28:15,735 --> 00:28:18,488
pwede kang mag-assistant coach.

428
00:28:18,571 --> 00:28:20,907
Salamat, pero pass ako dyan.

429
00:28:21,700 --> 00:28:23,076
Sige. Enjoy kayo.

430
00:28:25,245 --> 00:28:26,079
Coach.

431
00:28:26,162 --> 00:28:28,331
-Nice to see you. Bye.
-Kumusta?

432
00:28:31,251 --> 00:28:32,752
NIYAYAYA MO AKONG MAG-PIZZA DATE?

433
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:38,258
-Danny, ano 'yan? Bawal ang phone sa mesa.
-Sorry.

434
00:28:38,341 --> 00:28:41,386
May ka-text siyang babaeng taga-New York.

435
00:28:41,469 --> 00:28:42,595
Oh!

436
00:28:42,679 --> 00:28:45,598
-Finally, nandito na ang pizza.
-Iba ka, Danny.

437
00:28:45,682 --> 00:28:46,683
Ikaw, ah.

438
00:28:46,766 --> 00:28:49,853
-Mamaya na lang.
-Nagbibinata na siya.

439
00:28:50,353 --> 00:28:52,856
-Bagay ang breadsticks…
-Kung pwede, gagawin ko.

440
00:28:53,773 --> 00:28:54,774
Okay. Salamat.

441
00:28:54,858 --> 00:28:56,484
Kailangan kong lumakas.

442
00:29:15,170 --> 00:29:17,172
Hi, may maitutulong ba 'ko?

443
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:20,008
Wala. Thanks.

444
00:29:21,009 --> 00:29:22,177
Ayos ka lang ba?

445
00:29:22,927 --> 00:29:23,762
Oo.

446
00:29:24,262 --> 00:29:25,722
Alam mo na,

447
00:29:26,806 --> 00:29:27,807
nag-a-adjust pa 'ko.

448
00:29:33,438 --> 00:29:35,732
Ewan ko kung ano'ng nangyari sa kanya
no'ng summer…

449
00:29:36,232 --> 00:29:37,358
Nagbago siya, 'no?

450
00:29:37,859 --> 00:29:39,611
Oo, nagative na pagbabago.

451
00:29:45,074 --> 00:29:47,243
Nakaka-text ko 'tong babaeng 'to…

452
00:29:58,171 --> 00:29:59,005
Bukas 'yan.

453
00:30:01,090 --> 00:30:02,091
Hi.

454
00:30:03,176 --> 00:30:06,763
Gusto lang kitang kumustahin.
Di naging madali 'tong araw na 'to.

455
00:30:06,846 --> 00:30:08,848
Oo. Di naman 'to agad-agad.

456
00:30:08,932 --> 00:30:12,268
Sinubukan kong mag-take
ng Driver's Lesson, pero puno na.

457
00:30:12,936 --> 00:30:15,063
-Mag-aaral kang mag-drive?
-Oo.

458
00:30:15,146 --> 00:30:17,982
Para matulungan ko kayong
maghatid ng mga bata.

459
00:30:18,066 --> 00:30:20,777
Jackie, ang bait mo naman.

460
00:30:21,653 --> 00:30:25,824
Malaking tulong kung madadagdagan tayo
ng drivers pero di mo 'yon obligasyon.

461
00:30:29,786 --> 00:30:31,830
Di mo 'yon kailangang gawin.

462
